;;THE STAGE_Z DISPENSER, DEPLOYED LAST -- which is what CLAUDE.md has always said it is. It moved
;;here from Stage_01/[5.2] on 2026-09-20: DSP references TS02-C3 for the Stage Two emission injects,
;;and a module reference resolves at LOAD, so it cannot be loaded before the Stage 2 modules exist.
;;On chain this was never a problem -- DSP is live and gets UPGRADED after Stage 2 -- the REPL was
;;simply modelling an order the deployment does not use.
(load "Stage_02/[7.0]_Dispenser-Z.repl")
